      "label": "Verse 1",
      "number": "1",
      "deva": "भज गोविन्दं भज गोविन्दं\nगोविन्दं भज मूढमते ।\nसम्प्राप्ते सन्निहिते काले\nनहि नहि रक्षति डुकृङ्करणे ॥ १॥",
      "translation": "Worship Govinda, worship Govinda; worship Govinda, O foolish mind! When the time has arrived and is close at hand, no, no—the ḍukṛñkaraṇa grammar formula does not protect you.",
