    {
      "id": "bhaja-govindam-2",
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "number": "2",
      "deva": "मूढ जहीहि धनागमतृष्णां\nकुरु सद्बुद्धिं मनसि वितृष्णाम् ।\nयल्लभसे निजकर्मोपात्तं\nवित्तं तेन विनोदय चित्तम् ॥ २॥",
      "translation": "Fool, give up the thirst for accumulating wealth. Cultivate right understanding and freedom from craving in the mind. Be content with the wealth gained through your own actions.",
