      "id": "bhaja-govindam-3",
      "label": "Verse 3",
      "number": "3",
      "deva": "नारीस्तनभरनाभीदेशं\nदृष्ट्वा मा गा मोहावेशम् ।\nएतन्मांसवसादिविकारं\nमनसि विचिन्तय वारं वारम् ॥ ३॥",
      "translation": "On seeing a woman's breasts and navel, do not fall into the grip of delusion. Reflect again and again that these are transformations of flesh, fat, and the like.",
