    {
      "id": "bhaja-govindam-4",
      "label": "Verse 4",
      "number": "4",
      "deva": "नलिनीदलगतजलमतितरलं\nतद्वज्जीवितमतिशयचपलम् ।\nविद्धि व्याध्यभिमानग्रस्तं\nलोकं शोकहतं च समस्तम् ॥ ४॥",
      "translation": "Life is as fleeting as water on a lotus leaf. Know that the whole world is seized by illness and conceit, and struck by sorrow.",
