    {
      "id": "bhaja-govindam-5",
      "label": "Verse 5",
      "number": "5",
      "deva": "यावद्वित्तोपार्जनसक्त-\nस्तावन्निजपरिवारो रक्तः ।\nपश्चाज्जीवति जर्जरदेहे\nवार्तां कोऽपि न पृच्छति गेहे ॥ ५॥",
      "translation": "While you are intent on earning wealth, your family is attached to you. When you go on living in a worn-out body, no one at home asks after you.",
