      "id": "bhaja-govindam-6",
      "label": "Verse 6",
      "number": "6",
      "deva": "यावत्पवनो निवसति देहे\nतावत्पृच्छति कुशलं गेहे ।\nगतवति वायौ देहापाये\nभार्या बिभ्यति तस्मिन्काये ॥ ६॥",
      "translation": "While breath remains in the body, the household asks about your welfare. When the breath has gone and the body has fallen, even your wife fears that body.",
