    {
      "id": "bhaja-govindam-8",
      "label": "Verse 8",
      "number": "8",
      "deva": "का ते कान्ता कस्ते पुत्रः\nसंसारोऽयमतीव विचित्रः ।\nकस्य त्वं कः कुत आयात-\nस्तत्त्वं चिन्तय तदिह भ्रातः ॥ ८॥",
      "translation": "Who is your wife? Who is your son? This worldly life is indeed strange. Whose are you? Who are you? From where have you come? Brother, reflect here on the truth.",
