    {
      "id": "bhaja-govindam-24",
      "label": "Verse 24",
      "number": "24",
      "deva": "त्वयि मयि चान्यत्रैको विष्णु-\nर्व्यर्थं कुप्यसि मय्यसहिष्णुः ।\nभव समचित्तः सर्वत्र त्वं\nवाञ्छस्यचिराद्यदि विष्णुत्वम् ॥ २४॥",
      "translation": "The one Viṣṇu is in you, in me, and elsewhere. You grow angry at me in vain because you are intolerant. Be even-minded everywhere if you wish soon to attain the state of Viṣṇu.",
