      "label": "Verse 31",
      "number": "31",
      "deva": "गुरुचरणाम्बुजनिर्भरभक्तः\nसंसारादचिराद्भव मुक्तः ।\nसेन्द्रियमानसनियमादेवं\nद्रक्ष्यसि निजहृदयस्थं देवम् ॥ ३१॥",
      "translation": "With deep devotion to the lotus feet of the guru, be free from worldly existence before long. Through this discipline of the senses and mind, you will see the Lord dwelling in your own heart.",
